#ROOMS
#31008
Tipoca Landing~
Tipoca City stands on stilts above a black sea. The landing is a white
disk, and the rain has never stopped in the memory of the builders.
A Kaminoan in a long neck-collar waits with a manifest, unbothered by
the weather inside a faint weather field.
~
